  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.850" end="00:02.350" ttm:agent="v1">Where the fuck's my blunt?</p>
      <p begin="00:01.900" end="00:03.400" ttm:agent="v1">Where the fuck's my cup?</p>
      <p begin="00:02.780" end="00:04.280" ttm:agent="v1">Where the fuck's my reefer?</p>
      <p begin="00:03.860" end="00:06.220" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, huh, huh, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:06.220" end="00:07.720" ttm:agent="v1">I'm smokin' on kush</p>
      <p begin="00:06.800" end="00:09.340" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, huh, huh, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:09.340" end="00:10.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm smokin' on kush</p>
      <p begin="00:10.400" end="00:12.670" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, huh, huh, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:12.670" end="00:14.170" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm a chief?</p>
      <p begin="00:13.460" end="00:16.570" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, huh, huh, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:16.570" end="00:18.070" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm a chief?</p>
      <p begin="00:17.470" end="00:19.330" ttm:agent="v1">I'm flyin' just like an eagle</p>
      <p begin="00:19.330" end="00:20.900" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch cryin', I don't need her</p>
      <p begin="00:20.900" end="00:22.400" ttm:agent="v1">Four-five, long heater</p>
      <p begin="00:22.330" end="00:24.200" ttm:agent="v1">Hellcat big two-seater</p>
      <p begin="00:24.200" end="00:27.520" ttm:agent="v1">This bitch said she was hungry, this dick what I feed her</p>
      <p begin="00:27.520" end="00:31.130" ttm:agent="v1">I'm on the block servin' entrées, yeah, three-fives a reefer</p>
      <p begin="00:31.130" end="00:32.630" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, you know I'ma keep 'em</p>
      <p begin="00:32.440" end="00:34.440" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, and I be chiefin'</p>
      <p begin="00:34.440" end="00:37.790" ttm:agent="v1">All these hoes are some eaters, huh, huh, they'll be eatin'</p>
      <p begin="00:37.790" end="00:41.260" ttm:agent="v1">Cut the lights off, we gon' pull up creepin'</p>
      <p begin="00:41.260" end="00:44.280" ttm:agent="v1">We got four sticks, we're four deep, in the four-door Jeep</p>
      <p begin="00:44.280" end="00:47.760" ttm:agent="v1">My boy trigger finger itchin', leave his brains on the seat</p>
      <p begin="00:47.760" end="00:50.890" ttm:agent="v1">My trigger finger itchin', I feel like D-Wade with the heat</p>
      <p begin="00:50.890" end="00:55.270" ttm:agent="v1">Made him do the runnin' man, we sent some runnin' shots at his feet</p>
      <p begin="00:55.270" end="00:58.640" ttm:agent="v1">I pop X, I pop X, yeah, yeah, I'm geeked</p>
      <p begin="00:58.640" end="01:01.880" ttm:agent="v1">She pops X, she pops X, yeah, yeah, she sleeps</p>
      <p begin="01:01.880" end="01:05.340" ttm:agent="v1">Cullinan Rolls-Royce, I'm 'bout to pull up to a meet</p>
      <p begin="01:05.340" end="01:11.050" ttm:agent="v1">Let's play Russian roulette, bitch, who gon' die first, you or me?</p>
      <p begin="01:11.050" end="01:12.550" ttm:agent="v1">You or me?</p>
      <p begin="01:11.430" end="01:14.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let's play Russian roulette, bitch, who gon' die first, you or me?)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.180" end="01:17.670" ttm:agent="v1">You or me?</p>
      <p begin="01:17.670" end="01:19.170" ttm:agent="v1">You or me?</p>
      <p begin="01:18.940" end="01:21.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let's play Russian roulette, bitch, who gon' die first, you or me?)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.160" end="01:23.590" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:23.590" end="01:31.590" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:59.030" end="02:01.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Star made the beat, I just took it out of the oven)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.970" end="02:03.470" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:03.320" end="02:04.970" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:04.970" end="02:06.650" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:06.650" end="02:08.330" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:08.330" end="02:10.010" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:10.010" end="02:11.730" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:11.730" end="02:13.410" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:13.410" end="02:15.090" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:15.090" end="02:16.730" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:16.730" end="02:18.440" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:18.440" end="02:20.170" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:20.170" end="02:21.820" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:21.820" end="02:23.570" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:23.570" end="02:25.530" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:25.530" end="02:27.030" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my–, huh</p>
      <p begin="02:26.970" end="02:28.520" ttm:agent="v1">I've been fighting my demons, huh-yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:28.520" end="02:32.520" ttm:agent="v1"/>
